(7302937, 1138946, 177322, '<td valign="top">The balance of the opposing items each having their own negative space is clever framing.</td>', 'The balance of the opposing items each having their own negative space is clever framing.', '2015-01-16 10:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302939, 1139617, 177322, '<td valign="top">Superb feline portrait - good focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Superb feline portrait - good focus on the eyes.', '2015-01-16 10:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302943, 1139685, 177322, '<td valign="top">Well seen!  Striking colors.  The cabling adds a fillet (slip) of sorts which breaks up but actually accentuates the negative blue space.</td>', 'Well seen!  Striking colors.  The cabling adds a fillet (slip) of sorts which breaks up but actually accentuates the negative blue space.', '2015-01-16 10:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302946, 1139679, 177322, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Really creepy. There is a small constellation of gray dots in the black space that are vaguely distracting, but I really like how the black serves to define the shape of the head.  The texture layer adds a baleful dimension.  Usually, I''m not a fan of this sort of subject matter, but this is really well done.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'Creepy. Really creepy. There is a small constellation of gray dots in the black space that are vaguely distracting, but I really like how the black serves to define the shape of the head.  The texture layer adds a baleful dimension.  Usually, I''m not a fan of this sort of subject matter, but this is really well done.  Good luck with it.', '2015-01-16 10:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302949, 1139472, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed exposure in a challenging setting.  It matters not that the fire itself is dead centered because of the way you have framed the sparks.  Inventive entry for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nicely executed exposure in a challenging setting.  It matters not that the fire itself is dead centered because of the way you have framed the sparks.  Inventive entry for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2015-01-16 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302950, 1139590, 177322, '<td valign="top">Good leading line through this endless prairie and big sky.</td>', 'Good leading line through this endless prairie and big sky.', '2015-01-16 10:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302952, 1139095, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a fun celebration of a big - very big - sky.  Nicely composed for this challenge.</td>', 'What a fun celebration of a big - very big - sky.  Nicely composed for this challenge.', '2015-01-16 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302959, 1139609, 177322, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail does not do this image justice; I actually gasped slightly when I opened it. Aside from being a perfect submission for this challenge, the texture of the wood against the negative space bokeh is most interesting because of the similar colors.  But it was the cobwebs tethering that fantastically textured ball that really made an impression on me. I applaud this on many levels. Well seen.  Good luck.</td>', 'The thumbnail does not do this image justice; I actually gasped slightly when I opened it. Aside from being a perfect submission for this challenge, the texture of the wood against the negative space bokeh is most interesting because of the similar colors.  But it was the cobwebs tethering that fantastically textured ball that really made an impression on me. I applaud this on many levels. Well seen.  Good luck.', '2015-01-16 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302964, 1139174, 177322, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was a piece of wood until I saw the tiny people, then I thought, "Oh wow!"  Good luck.</td>', 'At first I thought it was a piece of wood until I saw the tiny people, then I thought, "Oh wow!"  Good luck.', '2015-01-16 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
