(7303593, 1139661, 174999, '<td valign="top">I am so captivated by this one, this is just beautiful and with the negative space, this is nailed .. this is my ribbon winner and a 10, well done, I wish I had snowy owls with me, one of my bucket lists to capture, you are lucky and these birds are so very rare to capture! Added to my favorites list. I am impressed.</td>', 'I am so captivated by this one, this is just beautiful and with the negative space, this is nailed .. this is my ribbon winner and a 10, well done, I wish I had snowy owls with me, one of my bucket lists to capture, you are lucky and these birds are so very rare to capture! Added to my favorites list. I am impressed.', '2015-01-17 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
