(7304083, 1139130, 60173, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a tiny bit brighter, but ah hell, favorite. The mood you captured and those cracks speak to me in ways I can''t explain.</td>', 'I wish this were a tiny bit brighter, but ah hell, favorite. The mood you captured and those cracks speak to me in ways I can''t explain.', '2015-01-19 12:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304086, 1139063, 60173, '<td valign="top">Is that a white San Marzano? What kind of tomatoes are those?<br/> <br/>Great idea overall. The light is also a little off balance (one-sided) for what I would imagine you were trying to do with it. I say this because there seems to be a lot of light on the one arm, but the other arm kind of drifts off into the darkness. This makes the one arm stand out more, hence unbalanced. I may be noticing this more, because your focus missed the tomatoes, and is unfortunately on the wrist. This makes me look more at the wrist than the tomatoes.</td>', 'Is that a white San Marzano? What kind of tomatoes are those? Great idea overall. The light is also a little off balance (one-sided) for what I would imagine you were trying to do with it. I say this because there seems to be a lot of light on the one arm, but the other arm kind of drifts off into the darkness. This makes the one arm stand out more, hence unbalanced. I may be noticing this more, because your focus missed the tomatoes, and is unfortunately on the wrist. This makes me look more at the wrist than the tomatoes.', '2015-01-19 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304087, 1139675, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love that you didn''t capture any of your vehicle in this shot. I feel like you''re standing in the middle of the highway, which I hope you''re not actually doing!</td>', 'I love that you didn''t capture any of your vehicle in this shot. I feel like you''re standing in the middle of the highway, which I hope you''re not actually doing!', '2015-01-19 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304133, 1139242, 96751, '<td valign="top">A lot of "negative space", but I just don''t find the content compelling.</td>', 'A lot of "negative space", but I just don''t find the content compelling.', '2015-01-19 15:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304135, 1139550, 96751, '<td valign="top">While there is a lot of empty "negative" space, I don''t feel it adds to the image.</td>', 'While there is a lot of empty "negative" space, I don''t feel it adds to the image.', '2015-01-19 15:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304136, 1139674, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me, the inclusion of a large, empty, "negative" space is to provide context for the subject, adding to the story. I don''t feel this image does that.</td>', 'For me, the inclusion of a large, empty, "negative" space is to provide context for the subject, adding to the story. I don''t feel this image does that.', '2015-01-19 15:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304137, 1139600, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like how the eye fills in the missing kitty parts.</td>', 'I like how the eye fills in the missing kitty parts.', '2015-01-19 15:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304138, 1139305, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, grain. Love the end feathers on the wing, but something is off on the composition for me.</td>', 'Nice tones, grain. Love the end feathers on the wing, but something is off on the composition for me.', '2015-01-19 15:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
