(7304247, 1139405, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Love the title. I''m sure the prep work for this shot was arduous, *hick*!<br/> <br/>Although the lighting and the comp are top notch,the distortion is a bit offputting. The ultrawide makes the entire image appear as if you are not squared off in front of the subject - the right side pulls away and seems to curve up.</td>', 'Hahaha! Love the title. I''m sure the prep work for this shot was arduous, *hick*! Although the lighting and the comp are top notch,the distortion is a bit offputting. The ultrawide makes the entire image appear as if you are not squared off in front of the subject - the right side pulls away and seems to curve up.', '2015-01-19 20:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304248, 1139130, 96751, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. Perhaps my favorite artsy shot of the challenge. The creation of the cosmos split down the middle by a shadow.</td>', 'Spectacular. Perhaps my favorite artsy shot of the challenge. The creation of the cosmos split down the middle by a shadow.', '2015-01-19 20:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
