(7304609, 1139066, 19825, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting image. Nicely done.', '2015-01-20 17:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304628, 1139308, 163430, '<td valign="top">This look very familiar. I''ve seen this scene before in the Ansel Adams challenge. It had a distracting centered horizon then, the one that we didn''t agree on :-)<br/> <br/>This one has a different feel to it. Totally un-Ansel-Adams.</td>', 'This look very familiar. I''ve seen this scene before in the Ansel Adams challenge. It had a distracting centered horizon then, the one that we didn''t agree on :-) This one has a different feel to it. Totally un-Ansel-Adams.', '2015-01-20 18:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304635, 1139530, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts. If only the crane was flying towards the negative space instead from it.</td>', 'Nice contrasts. If only the crane was flying towards the negative space instead from it.', '2015-01-20 18:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304660, 1139242, 135629, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10, not because it''s the exact and most dramatic representation of the core belief behind stylized negative space in photography, but because I completely didn''t expect this exact shot, and I think it is very well done.</td>', 'I gave this a 10, not because it''s the exact and most dramatic representation of the core belief behind stylized negative space in photography, but because I completely didn''t expect this exact shot, and I think it is very well done.', '2015-01-20 20:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304661, 1139647, 135629, '<td valign="top">Lots of obvious negative space here, it is sharp, well lit, and a great fit for the challenge. 9</td>', 'Lots of obvious negative space here, it is sharp, well lit, and a great fit for the challenge. 9', '2015-01-20 20:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304662, 1138946, 135629, '<td valign="top">This is another shot in this challenge I can see as a text-book image right below the chapter titled "Negative Space &amp; Photography". Made a bit more interesting with dueling subjects. 8</td>', 'This is another shot in this challenge I can see as a text-book image right below the chapter titled "Negative Space & Photography". Made a bit more interesting with dueling subjects. 8', '2015-01-20 20:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304663, 1139296, 135629, '<td valign="top">This is a great entry, it challenges the text book negative space images by making the negative space interesting. The subject is clear, and because it is colored so differently from the surrounding space it really works here, I gave this one a 9 because I think it''s a great entry for the challenge that also can educate people''s understanding of what negative space is in photography... Showing that an image with negative space doesn''t have to be a solid swatch of nothing surrounding a sharply captured subject in the thirds.</td>', 'This is a great entry, it challenges the text book negative space images by making the negative space interesting. The subject is clear, and because it is colored so differently from the surrounding space it really works here, I gave this one a 9 because I think it''s a great entry for the challenge that also can educate people''s understanding of what negative space is in photography... Showing that an image with negative space doesn''t have to be a solid swatch of nothing surrounding a sharply captured subject in the thirds.', '2015-01-20 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304665, 1139609, 135629, '<td valign="top">Really neat subject here, love the detail and the spider webs.</td>', 'Really neat subject here, love the detail and the spider webs.', '2015-01-20 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304667, 1139679, 135629, '<td valign="top">Sinister, thought provoking, and other worldly. Great entry for the challenge, the only thing I might add is the splotches of gray toward the right side (in the black) steal your eyes from the subject more than you might want.</td>', 'Sinister, thought provoking, and other worldly. Great entry for the challenge, the only thing I might add is the splotches of gray toward the right side (in the black) steal your eyes from the subject more than you might want.', '2015-01-20 20:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304668, 1139061, 135629, '<td valign="top">Well captured, great lighting, and I am totally feeling the negative space with this one. If the rose petals were not being clipped by the right and bottom border I think that would have been perfect.</td>', 'Well captured, great lighting, and I am totally feeling the negative space with this one. If the rose petals were not being clipped by the right and bottom border I think that would have been perfect.', '2015-01-20 20:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
