(7305981, 1139174, 129807, '<td valign="top">I too thought this was a piece of rough sawn timber; what an incredible place and you''ve captured it perfectly. The scale drawn by the inclusion of the people is awe inspiring. Where is this?</td>', 'I too thought this was a piece of rough sawn timber; what an incredible place and you''ve captured it perfectly. The scale drawn by the inclusion of the people is awe inspiring. Where is this?', '2015-01-23 05:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7305982, 1139682, 129807, '<td valign="top">The sky colour and reflection of same is what speaks to me in this image; it shouts out about the cold and distant galaxy watching over us. One slight nitpick - although the image is tonally cold, I feel the spit of land might perhaps benefit from the application of a warmer tone. Perhaps, perhaps not. I''d be interested to see it. Congratulations on TT. :)</td>', 'The sky colour and reflection of same is what speaks to me in this image; it shouts out about the cold and distant galaxy watching over us. One slight nitpick - although the image is tonally cold, I feel the spit of land might perhaps benefit from the application of a warmer tone. Perhaps, perhaps not. I''d be interested to see it. Congratulations on TT. :)', '2015-01-23 05:36:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7305983, 1139530, 163430, '<td valign="top">I see the photographer''s comments now. You cropped from the left?! Why? If you cropped from the right, the negative space would have a totally different meaning. The crane would have somewhere to fly to. The effectiveness of this, of course, depends on what''s there in the cropped part of the image.<br/></td>', 'I see the photographer''s comments now. You cropped from the left?! Why? If you cropped from the right, the negative space would have a totally different meaning. The crane would have somewhere to fly to. The effectiveness of this, of course, depends on what''s there in the cropped part of the image.', '2015-01-23 06:12:48.000000', NULL, 0),
