(7306149, 1139590, 78757, '<td valign="top">My first TT finish. Thanks for all the positive votes.<br/> <br/>It was a cold and foggy day (I know, it sounds like the opening to a bad novel) and the world was encased in icy glory. I was happy to have the chance to be out collecting moments of beauty that day.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the nice comments.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting!</td>', 'My first TT finish. Thanks for all the positive votes. It was a cold and foggy day (I know, it sounds like the opening to a bad novel) and the world was encased in icy glory. I was happy to have the chance to be out collecting moments of beauty that day. Thanks for the nice comments. Keep shooting!', '2015-01-23 15:14:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306158, 1139661, 98339, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours...beautiful capture!!!  I''m quite envious that you have these birds anywhere near you so you can go out n shoot them!!!!  What I''d give to be able to see one in the wild.</td>', 'I thought this might be yours...beautiful capture!!!  I''m quite envious that you have these birds anywhere near you so you can go out n shoot them!!!!  What I''d give to be able to see one in the wild.', '2015-01-23 15:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
