(7306171, 1139648, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MikeO:</b></div><hr/><i> The tones in this are excellent. You broke your Monochrom ?!! Oh dear :( </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually Mike, it broke itself.. had a few dead pixels mapped out by Leica and when it came back it had a scratch on the sensor but nobody can explain how.. The service from Leica is excellent &amp; I am confident the repair will be done FOC but might take some time, meanwhile I have an M9 to play with.</td>', 'Originally posted by MikeO: The tones in this are excellent. You broke your Monochrom ?!! Oh dear :(   Actually Mike, it broke itself.. had a few dead pixels mapped out by Leica and when it came back it had a scratch on the sensor but nobody can explain how.. The service from Leica is excellent & I am confident the repair will be done FOC but might take some time, meanwhile I have an M9 to play with.', '2015-01-23 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
