(7306803, 1139648, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MikeO:</b></div><hr/><i> The tones in this are excellent. You broke your Monochrom ?!! Oh dear :( </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually Mike, it broke itself.. had a few dead pixels mapped out by Leica and when it came back it had a scratch on the sensor but nobody can explain how.. The service from Leica is excellent &amp; I am confident the repair will be done FOC but might take some time, meanwhile I have an M9 to play with. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeh, I did not think you would have broke it ! Hope you get it back soon, an M9 is a decent stand-in !<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by MAK: Originally posted by MikeO: The tones in this are excellent. You broke your Monochrom ?!! Oh dear :(   Actually Mike, it broke itself.. had a few dead pixels mapped out by Leica and when it came back it had a scratch on the sensor but nobody can explain how.. The service from Leica is excellent & I am confident the repair will be done FOC but might take some time, meanwhile I have an M9 to play with.   Yeh, I did not think you would have broke it ! Hope you get it back soon, an M9 is a decent stand-in ! ', '2015-01-26 08:18:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7307164, 1139635, 2553, '<td valign="top">I agree with vawendy...it''s an absolutely perfect negative space for this subject.  He is incredibly photogenic and the light is perfect on his face, I would hate to see anything at all that distracts from that.  Well done, as always.<br/></td>', 'I agree with vawendy...it''s an absolutely perfect negative space for this subject.  He is incredibly photogenic and the light is perfect on his face, I would hate to see anything at all that distracts from that.  Well done, as always.', '2015-01-27 12:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
