(7307826, 1139677, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mefnj:</b></div><hr/><i> might have cloned out the plane trails, really detracts from the majesty </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The light streak in the upper middle is a meteor.  The flashing light to the right of Ypsilon Mountain is a plane.  Both are major elements of interest.  No need to clone out major elements.  My philosophy is to present images without Photoshopping.</td>', 'Originally posted by mefnj: might have cloned out the plane trails, really detracts from the majesty  The light streak in the upper middle is a meteor.  The flashing light to the right of Ypsilon Mountain is a plane.  Both are major elements of interest.  No need to clone out major elements.  My philosophy is to present images without Photoshopping.', '2015-01-29 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
